    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_Summon700_Bahamut_03:Summon700_Bahamut_03_019:49c1db8b",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_Summon700_Bahamut_03",
        "key": "Summon700_Bahamut_03_019",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_Summon700_Bahamut_03:Summon700_Bahamut_03_019:49c1db8b",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_Summon700_Bahamut_03:Summon700_Bahamut_03_019:49c1db8b",
        "jp_sha256": "c2dd8fa5f1823cdf437767e816166e631ca3c761acc17112ec1e5a16c19a754b",
        "official_en_sha256": "e1c0c3805479cbc7c7095f7759ea270d4409fa2ff2feb0342a36d6e1f934343c"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ならば、我を前にしても\r\nその小さき理由を貫くことができるか？",
        "official_en": "Then I ask thee—for such a meager cause,\nart thou nonetheless prepared to stand unshaken before my might?",
        "real_en": "Then can you hold true to that small reason even when you stand before me?"
      },
